    "causal_summary": "Four small, unrelated structural irregularities surfaced during the hub-wide template audit that don't belong to any single mode's own conformance child: a vestigial empty test-result stub sitting where a real dependency install would go, four loose executable scripts at a packet root when every sibling mode keeps its executables under `scripts/` or `corpus/`, a benchmark run-category directory missing the index file its siblings all have, and two structural absences (`procedures/` in one mode, `scripts/` in another) that are legitimate rather than gaps",
